  title: "Lunch Break (12:30 PM \u2013 1:30 PM) "
  info: 'Lunch is a social affair, with office workers and students heading to hawker
    centers, food courts, or cafes. Popular choices include Hainanese chicken rice,
    laksa, or economy rice. Some may use this time to run errands or take a short
    rest before resuming work.  '
